  "plot_summary": "[ASSET: right | PreChecklist | width=33%] In the days before there was a <i>Mighty Marvel Checklist</i>, you had to get the main list of superhero books on sale this month from one of the letters pages in the form of a <b>Special Announcement</b>, in this case, from [LINK:1963:ASM_5|ASM #5] (which also mentions both <i>Avengers</i> and <i>X-Men</i> as new titles).\n[BR]\n[BR] The Annuals on sale were mentioned in this month's Fantastic Four -- seems like it matches my list, so I've apparently done a decent job reconstructing the publication history thus far.",
  "meanwhile": {
